{
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "I tell Mika that I enjoy talking with her, but I am not looking for a date tonight.",
      "type": "playerAction",
      "source": "I tell Mika that I enjoy talking with her, but I am not looking for a date tonight."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "That is fair. I appreciate the clarity. It saves us both from guessing.",
      "type": "npcSpeech"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Mika straightens in her chair, the movement unhurried. She reaches for her mug, takes a sip, and sets it down with a soft click against the desk.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "I was hoping to find someone for a slow weekend walk. Just a walk. No itinerary, no pressure to be the organiser. If you are free Saturday morning, I am going to the bakery on the hill. The lemon cake is still in the oven, so I will need to test it before it cools. You can bring your own definition of success.",
      "type": "npcSpeech"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "She gathers her notebook and pen, tucking them into her bag. The rain has stopped, leaving a wet sheen on the window glass behind her.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "Good talk. I will see you if the cake holds its shape. Or if it doesn't. Either way, it is a good morning.",
      "type": "npcSpeech"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The player clarifies they are not seeking a date, which Mika accepts with gratitude for the directness. Mika then invites the player to join her for a casual Saturday morning bakery visit and walk, framing it as a low-pressure social outing rather than a date. She concludes the conversation and leaves the office.",
  "end_scene": true,
  "memories": [
    {
      "charKey": "selma-aydn",
      "type": "neutral",
      "desc": "Player is direct about not wanting a date, which Mika appreciates as it removes ambiguity."
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    {
      "subject": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "Mika has invited the player to join her for a Saturday morning walk and bakery visit.",
      "quote": "If you are free Saturday morning, I am going to the bakery on the hill."
    }
  ],
  "acts": [
    {
      "kind": "listen",
      "target": "conversation",
      "size": "small",
      "landed": true
    }
  ]
}

